WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.365
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:06.059
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:16.853
They see a doctor's office.

4
00:00:16.854 --> 00:00:21.126
It's time for a checkup!

5
00:00:21.127 --> 00:00:47.854
They check their height.

6
00:00:47.855 --> 00:01:14.892
They check their weight.

7
00:01:14.893 --> 00:01:25.797
They check their eyes.

8
00:01:25.798 --> 00:01:42.921
They check their tongues.

9
00:01:42.922 --> 00:01:54.850
They check their knees.

10
00:01:54.851 --> 00:02:26.156
They check their hearts.

11
00:02:26.157 --> 00:02:41.256
Blobs, don't play with the gloves.

12
00:02:41.257 --> 00:02:44.133
Silly blobs!

13
00:02:44.134 --> 00:02:48.115
Good-bye!

